  "question": {
    "text": "The number of real roots of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is : <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math>"
  },
